  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nepal Local Infrastructure Support Programme (LISP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Local Infrastructure Support Programme will improve Nepal&#x2019;s new local and provincial governments&#x2019; delivery of the local infrastructure services demanded by rural citizens to create jobs and drive economic development. LISP will do this by providing technical assistance and performance-based capital funding to improve the delivery and resilience of local infrastructure. It will focus on increasing the legitimacy and accountability of local government to their citizens. LISP will directly support the use of the systems and capacity developed by the sister Provincial and Local Government Support Programme.</narrative>
  </description>
